00036:         "content": "Actually read complete StartBattleCore279–317, both side predicates, fainted? getter, blank initialization, pbInitialize/pbInitPokemon60–91 and participant/index declarations; actual WP39 purpose/scope1–52 and WP41 purpose/qualification/cancel/recall/entry1–104. Nine exact units with fixed identities."
