00038:       "source_credit": "CORE retains original whole source/formal FULL. This different reviewer actually reads the complete finite13+4 contributed units and nine own necessary units; no parent FULL is transferred or newly inferred by hashes. Main KERNEL whole-source count is unchanged by this counter.",
00039:       "fixed_B8": "fd1df570cad987dc3852a3b958f03916e317f7fe",
